  "evidence": "- TEXT_C: Welfare and NHS reserved for Britons and contributors only; replace welfare with workfare; end “health tourism.” Crime policy restoring deterrence, with corporal/capital punishment and full sentences. Immigration halted, deportations of illegals/foreign criminals, repeal of Race Relations Act, prioritising indigenous Britons. Cultural/constitutional emphasis on British history, traditions, saints’ days, and a compulsory one‑year community service. Economy pledges to curb multinationals’ tax avoidance/offshoring and vet foreign takeovers; selective tariffs. Bans on burka/ritual slaughter/new mosques; traditional curricula, streaming, and grammar schools.\n- TEXT_D: Raise personal allowance to £10,000 funded by taxing capital gains at income rates, Mansion Tax, and anti‑avoidance/evasion. Pupil Premium, phased scrapping of tuition fees, targeted bursaries. NHS frontline protection, carers’ respite, end child detention in immigration, humane asylum with right to work. Freedom Bill rolling back surveillance; restorative justice and presumption against short sentences. Pro‑Europe, internationalist stance and 0.7% aid; electoral reform to fair votes and caps on donations.",
